TITLE Calcite kinetics with Cu and Ba at 200C, pH 2

SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    pe 4
    Cu 0.01
    Ba 0.005

KINETICS 1
    Calcite_kin
        -formula CaCO3 1
        -m0 1
        -parms 10 1.0
        -steps 1000 in 100 steps

RATES
Calcite_kin
    -start
    10 k = PARM(1)
    20 sA = PARM(2)
    30 rate = k * sA
    40 moles = rate * TIME
    50 SAVE moles
    -end

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selout.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -molalities Ba+2 BaCO3
    -si Witherite Calcite
    -totals Ba C Ca Cu
    -dist 1

END
